WEBVTT

00:01:43.840 --> 00:01:45.700
Where's the Insect Magistrate's Office?

00:01:46.950 --> 00:01:48.880
Are you lost?

00:01:48.880 --> 00:01:52.460
Anyway, you really stink...

00:01:53.640 --> 00:01:55.750
So, the Magistrate's, right?

00:01:56.500 --> 00:02:00.250
Just around that corner, then go straight.

00:02:00.250 --> 00:02:01.900
Wait, no...

00:02:01.900 --> 00:02:03.470
Was it this way?

00:02:05.270 --> 00:02:08.230
If you don't know, I don't need you anymore.

00:02:34.420 --> 00:02:36.510
<b>Insect!? Man!? 
A Mysterious Enemy Attacks!</b>

00:02:39.410 --> 00:02:42.930
Why are you always causing problems?

00:02:42.930 --> 00:02:47.020
The City Patrol really is a bunch 
of low-class incompetents.

00:02:47.020 --> 00:02:49.330
I am very sorry...

00:02:49.330 --> 00:02:52.450
I don't need your apologies!

00:02:52.450 --> 00:02:57.030
I need to know why the entire 
City Patrol is on vacation!

00:02:57.770 --> 00:02:59.260
Well, you see...

00:02:59.260 --> 00:03:01.640
Everyone insisted...

00:03:01.640 --> 00:03:03.320
When will they return?

00:03:03.320 --> 00:03:04.530
A-Ah...

00:03:04.910 --> 00:03:06.380
Where did they go?

00:03:06.380 --> 00:03:08.290
Well...

00:03:09.260 --> 00:03:12.040
<i>It isn't fair that only Tsukishima gets a vacation.</i>

00:03:13.550 --> 00:03:15.910
<i>You can handle things yourself, Kotori-chan.</i>

00:03:15.910 --> 00:03:17.300
<i>Have fun.</i>

00:03:18.810 --> 00:03:21.300
<i>I'll be off, as well...</i>

00:03:23.290 --> 00:03:25.050
<i>Wait, everyone!</i>

00:03:26.540 --> 00:03:28.140
<i>You're abandoning your jobs!</i>

00:03:29.920 --> 00:03:32.480
<i>Mugai-kun's gone, too.</i>

00:03:33.300 --> 00:03:36.070
<i>Everyone, I'm cutting your salary.</i>

00:03:36.070 --> 00:03:37.940
Matsunohara!

00:03:38.730 --> 00:03:42.010
B-But Jinbei-kun isn't on vacation...

00:03:42.010 --> 00:03:43.430
He's training.

00:03:43.430 --> 00:03:46.150
The fact that he isn't here 
makes him just as guilty.

00:03:46.890 --> 00:03:49.000
I can't really disagree.

00:03:49.000 --> 00:03:50.190
It doesn't matter...

00:03:50.190 --> 00:03:54.040
I never expected anything from 
the City Patrol, anyway.

00:03:54.530 --> 00:03:55.470
Huh?

00:04:01.270 --> 00:04:03.720
Shirasagaki-dono, what are those?

00:04:05.150 --> 00:04:06.390
Now, Matsunohara...

00:04:06.870 --> 00:04:08.560
Behold!

00:04:13.000 --> 00:04:13.850
These are...

00:04:16.400 --> 00:04:20.380
Five cannons, bought with my 
massive personal fortune.

00:04:21.060 --> 00:04:24.410
I've improved on the previous designs 
to make them more powerful.

00:04:24.940 --> 00:04:29.080
Now Edo will be safe without you.

00:04:31.120 --> 00:04:35.330
<i>So he called me here
 to show these off, huh?</i>

00:04:36.940 --> 00:04:39.000
T-Trouble!

00:04:39.330 --> 00:04:40.940
Yumehisa-sama...

00:04:40.940 --> 00:04:42.750
What is it? You're quite loud.

00:04:42.750 --> 00:04:43.760
W-Well...

00:04:44.200 --> 00:04:46.090
Edo... Edo is...

00:04:55.520 --> 00:04:57.600
This is great...

00:04:57.600 --> 00:04:59.400
I can't wait to tell Oharu-dono.

00:05:00.050 --> 00:05:05.240
Yeah, I must try these dumplings 
you're always talking about.

00:05:05.240 --> 00:05:06.700
Yes, Father.

00:05:06.700 --> 00:05:08.860
These dumplings are splendid,

00:05:08.860 --> 00:05:13.500
but the dumplings at Shunkashutou are 
so soft, bouncy, and delicious...

00:05:13.500 --> 00:05:15.040
Hey...

00:05:15.340 --> 00:05:17.590
Can someone help me?

00:05:18.400 --> 00:05:19.880
Wh-What?

00:05:23.510 --> 00:05:26.140
What happened to him?

00:05:26.620 --> 00:05:30.100
All the villages I passed on my 
way here were destroyed.

00:05:30.710 --> 00:05:31.870
Villages?

00:05:34.400 --> 00:05:39.210
He was the only one left alive, 
so I brought him here.

00:05:41.230 --> 00:05:43.360
I-Insects...

00:05:44.030 --> 00:05:47.510
Insects that looked like men...

00:05:47.510 --> 00:05:50.260
They killed us in an instant.

00:05:50.640 --> 00:05:53.370
Mister, where did they go?

00:05:54.530 --> 00:05:57.870
They flew toward Edo.

00:05:58.320 --> 00:06:01.050
They were looking for the 
Insect Magistrate's Office.

00:06:01.450 --> 00:06:03.190
The Insect Magistrate's...

00:06:04.410 --> 00:06:05.130
Father—

00:06:07.810 --> 00:06:09.400
Father...

00:06:09.400 --> 00:06:12.140
If you have time to worry, 
you have time to move!

00:06:12.830 --> 00:06:16.890
Show them the new Tsukishima-style 
techniques you've learned!

00:06:18.370 --> 00:06:20.270
Yes, Father!

00:06:20.270 --> 00:06:23.170
I'm on my way!

00:06:38.330 --> 00:06:40.040
What is this?

00:06:55.210 --> 00:06:56.300
Oops.

00:06:56.300 --> 00:06:59.100
I just meant to eat one, 
but you can't help it sometimes.

00:06:59.410 --> 00:07:00.930
I-It talked!

00:07:01.320 --> 00:07:03.230
Is it not an insect?

00:07:03.230 --> 00:07:04.230
It can't be.

00:07:05.260 --> 00:07:09.240
How many did it kill on its way here?

00:07:09.820 --> 00:07:12.730
And how dare it attack our city?

00:07:13.610 --> 00:07:16.240
You insect!

00:07:23.020 --> 00:07:26.460
My Murakumo's bullets don't hurt it?

00:07:28.350 --> 00:07:30.420
I know you.

00:07:30.420 --> 00:07:32.890
You're with the Insect Magistrate's Office.

00:07:32.890 --> 00:07:35.470
Where's that weird young samurai?

00:07:35.840 --> 00:07:37.420
Young samurai?

00:07:37.420 --> 00:07:38.470
Who are you talking about?

00:07:39.850 --> 00:07:42.810
If you don't know, that's fine.

00:07:43.450 --> 00:07:44.500
It disappeared?

00:07:48.120 --> 00:07:48.980
Shirasagaki-dono!

00:07:56.150 --> 00:08:00.250
Oogami Kagetada, Samurai House Patrol, 
here to help!

00:08:00.540 --> 00:08:02.210
Then I'll help, as well.

00:08:02.210 --> 00:08:04.750
We don't require the useless City Patrol's help!

00:08:04.750 --> 00:08:06.060
But...

00:08:06.060 --> 00:08:08.670
You assist the injured or something.

00:08:12.240 --> 00:08:16.820
Matsunohara, take him to be treated.

00:08:16.820 --> 00:08:19.100
Leave him to us!

00:08:19.570 --> 00:08:20.560
Very well.

00:08:22.210 --> 00:08:24.310
Stop it from escaping!

00:08:24.310 --> 00:08:25.670
Silkworm formation!

00:08:34.940 --> 00:08:37.660
Shirasagaki, we'll attack together.

00:08:37.660 --> 00:08:38.410
Understood.

00:08:42.430 --> 00:08:44.040
<i>A single deadly strike!</i>

00:08:44.040 --> 00:08:45.600
<i>Blade Hand!</i>

00:08:50.500 --> 00:08:52.800
<i>Beautiful and elegant!</i>

00:08:53.520 --> 00:08:54.840
<i>Saibara Dance!</i>

00:09:00.590 --> 00:09:01.850
It didn't work?

00:09:02.170 --> 00:09:04.100
Then how about this?

00:09:07.560 --> 00:09:09.420
Taste my five cannons...

00:09:09.420 --> 00:09:11.610
The Temple and Shrine Patrol's power!

00:09:23.910 --> 00:09:24.970
Impossible.

00:09:24.970 --> 00:09:27.500
My cannons had no effect...

00:09:29.520 --> 00:09:30.620
I won't give up!

00:09:30.620 --> 00:09:32.930
Keep firing!

00:09:56.290 --> 00:09:57.890
Interesting.

00:09:58.670 --> 00:10:00.910
But it'll take more than that...

00:10:01.210 --> 00:10:03.270
Let's go, monster!

00:10:03.270 --> 00:10:05.160
I haven't fought nearly enough!

00:10:08.540 --> 00:10:09.740
It's useless.

00:10:29.060 --> 00:10:30.850
<i>What a shame.</i>

00:10:32.800 --> 00:10:35.360
<i>I couldn't do a thing...</i>

00:10:35.870 --> 00:10:37.750
I will ask again.

00:10:38.690 --> 00:10:42.610
Is that strange young samurai 
with the Insect Magistrate's?

00:10:45.190 --> 00:10:46.160
I don't know.

00:10:47.350 --> 00:10:48.330
I see.

00:10:48.780 --> 00:10:51.070
Then die.

00:10:59.580 --> 00:11:01.050
Tsukishima...

00:11:02.240 --> 00:11:03.290
Jinbei?

00:11:10.690 --> 00:11:14.820
Honor demands you refrain from 
interfering in another's battle.

00:11:15.790 --> 00:11:18.570
Please tell me one thing.

00:11:19.520 --> 00:11:22.880
Did it do all this?

00:11:23.890 --> 00:11:25.400
Oh!

00:11:25.400 --> 00:11:27.080
Then you are he.

00:11:27.080 --> 00:11:29.100
I found you.

00:11:31.590 --> 00:11:34.590
Time to get rid of you!

00:11:37.080 --> 00:11:38.020
Oh, no...

00:11:38.020 --> 00:11:39.620
Get back, Tsukishima!

00:11:39.620 --> 00:11:42.090
You can't fight him!

00:11:45.250 --> 00:11:47.470
<i>It's so fast...</i>

00:11:51.530 --> 00:11:53.850
He's keeping up with that monster.

00:11:57.720 --> 00:12:00.860
Always be ready for a fight!

00:12:08.470 --> 00:12:11.620
He defeated something we couldn't touch?

00:12:29.100 --> 00:12:31.980
Koga-style Insect Ninjutsu.

00:12:32.670 --> 00:12:34.270
Wh-What?

00:12:35.800 --> 00:12:37.160
Ninjutsu?

00:12:37.160 --> 00:12:39.650
Is that a clone technique?

00:12:39.990 --> 00:12:42.760
Then, one of them is an illusion?

00:12:42.760 --> 00:12:44.660
So I just need to attack them both again.

00:12:52.910 --> 00:12:55.940
<i>It feels real... This is no illusion!</i>

00:13:00.190 --> 00:13:01.300
Did he win?

00:13:01.960 --> 00:13:03.580
I felt the blade pierce it.

00:13:12.710 --> 00:13:14.470
It cloned itself again?

00:13:14.470 --> 00:13:16.960
Who said I was cloning myself?

00:13:18.660 --> 00:13:21.700
This is a secret technique of 
Koga-style Insect Ninjutsu,

00:13:21.700 --> 00:13:23.980
Splitting Technique.

00:13:23.980 --> 00:13:29.170
Each time I am killed, I maintain 
my power and increase in number.

00:13:33.250 --> 00:13:37.430
This splendid body makes that possible.

00:13:38.670 --> 00:13:44.640
You humans have no hope of victory against us.

00:13:45.830 --> 00:13:46.790
Go...

00:13:46.790 --> 00:13:48.760
Kill the young samurai!

00:14:07.550 --> 00:14:08.820
<i>The more I kill,</i>

00:14:09.990 --> 00:14:11.330
<i>the more there are.</i>

00:14:16.440 --> 00:14:18.540
<i>What should I do?</i>

00:14:22.650 --> 00:14:25.260
It's over, young samurai.

00:14:30.450 --> 00:14:34.990
Sarutobi Sasuke has slain the young samurai!

00:14:44.310 --> 00:14:46.170
What's wrong with you, Tsukishima?

00:14:46.170 --> 00:14:48.650
You're always so slow.

00:14:49.230 --> 00:14:50.660
Hibachi-dono!

00:14:51.250 --> 00:14:52.300
Koikawa-dono!

00:14:53.100 --> 00:14:54.240
Tenma-dono!

00:14:55.090 --> 00:14:58.290
Hey, monsters.

00:14:58.290 --> 00:15:01.550
You've been causing damage while we were off

00:15:01.550 --> 00:15:04.420
on our little training mission.

00:15:04.420 --> 00:15:06.420
What? You were training?

00:15:06.750 --> 00:15:09.430
I'll slice you to ribbons, insects!

00:15:15.390 --> 00:15:16.860
<i>Hydrangea Blossoms!</i>

00:15:16.860 --> 00:15:18.380
<i>Repentance Slash.</i>

00:15:18.380 --> 00:15:20.700
<i>Full-Power Slap!</i>

00:15:27.320 --> 00:15:29.140
Too easy.

00:15:29.140 --> 00:15:30.100
All right!

00:15:31.040 --> 00:15:33.320
So these wimps gave you trouble?

00:15:34.000 --> 00:15:36.540
Have you gotten weaker?

00:15:36.540 --> 00:15:37.580
We haven't won yet.

00:16:10.040 --> 00:16:11.860
What is this?

00:16:11.860 --> 00:16:13.260
A blade's no good.

00:16:13.260 --> 00:16:16.370
They divide with their splitting technique.

00:16:19.860 --> 00:16:21.450
If we can't use blades,

00:16:24.530 --> 00:16:26.310
I'll burn them!

00:16:34.460 --> 00:16:36.050
So annoying! And gross!

00:16:36.180 --> 00:16:38.060
Not using blades isn't an option.

00:16:38.060 --> 00:16:39.060
<i>Matsukichi!</i>

00:16:39.060 --> 00:16:40.060
<i>Tamekichi!</i>

00:16:40.060 --> 00:16:42.810
<i>Full-Power Slap!</i>

00:16:50.040 --> 00:16:51.570
There are too many.

00:16:51.570 --> 00:16:53.030
Let's fall back.

00:16:53.030 --> 00:16:54.110
No!

00:16:54.420 --> 00:16:58.460
Do you know how many it's killed?

00:16:58.460 --> 00:17:03.260
If we retreat here, even more will die.

00:17:03.720 --> 00:17:06.610
We cannot run now.

00:17:07.280 --> 00:17:10.270
But what do we do?

00:17:11.050 --> 00:17:13.040
We can't fight these guys...

00:17:13.900 --> 00:17:15.510
There must be something.

00:17:15.990 --> 00:17:17.120
Something...

00:17:19.790 --> 00:17:21.640
Look over there.

00:17:22.330 --> 00:17:23.990
One's still on the ground.

00:17:25.370 --> 00:17:26.560
Over there, too.

00:17:26.560 --> 00:17:28.150
Wh-What?

00:17:28.410 --> 00:17:30.370
Who cares?

00:17:30.370 --> 00:17:31.150
Because...

00:17:31.410 --> 00:17:34.650
Why do some regenerate, while others don't?

00:17:35.130 --> 00:17:36.680
You're right...

00:17:37.210 --> 00:17:38.790
Th-Their heads!

00:17:38.790 --> 00:17:41.660
Look, those bodies have no heads!

00:17:41.990 --> 00:17:44.250
Wait, does that mean...

00:17:44.660 --> 00:17:46.250
If we destroy the heads...

00:17:46.710 --> 00:17:48.500
They won't split?

00:17:48.500 --> 00:17:51.150
But we have to do it simultaneously.

00:17:51.150 --> 00:17:54.810
If we let a single one survive, 
they'll go elsewhere and split again.

00:17:54.810 --> 00:17:55.950
Come on...

00:17:55.950 --> 00:17:59.260
How will we kill so many at once?

00:17:59.260 --> 00:18:00.760
I know how!

00:18:00.760 --> 00:18:03.020
I have an idea.

00:18:03.520 --> 00:18:06.720
Will you help me?

00:18:08.470 --> 00:18:11.210
Humans, how you struggle doesn't matter.

00:18:11.210 --> 00:18:13.030
It will avail you naught!

00:18:17.840 --> 00:18:19.250
I won't let you escape!

00:18:23.870 --> 00:18:27.670
It doesn't matter what you do.

00:18:27.670 --> 00:18:29.630
You'll just make me stronger.

00:18:30.240 --> 00:18:32.310
We're counting on you, Tsukishima.

00:18:34.150 --> 00:18:35.380
Take 'em out.

00:18:46.840 --> 00:18:48.980
<i>Tsukishima-style:</i>

00:18:51.370 --> 00:18:54.970
<i>Fuji Hammer!</i>

00:19:14.240 --> 00:19:18.260
You killed us all at once?

00:19:40.830 --> 00:19:42.430
Not bad.

00:19:42.430 --> 00:19:46.460
Seems a long time since 
we were all together...

00:19:47.210 --> 00:19:50.210
Even though it's only been three days.

00:19:50.210 --> 00:19:52.750
They defeated that monster...

00:19:52.750 --> 00:19:54.790
The City Patrol.

00:19:55.810 --> 00:20:00.360
With your help, I managed 
to defeat the monsters...

00:20:00.360 --> 00:20:02.300
Thank you so much!

00:20:03.860 --> 00:20:05.930
<i>I did it, Father...</i>

00:20:05.930 --> 00:20:10.520
<i>I was able to use the Fuji Hammer in battle!</i>

00:20:28.980 --> 00:20:30.260
Kotori-dono...

00:20:31.080 --> 00:20:33.330
The Insect-men have made it to Edo...

00:20:35.050 --> 00:20:36.340
Insect-men?

00:20:40.880 --> 00:20:40.940
<b>Kishuu Province</b>

00:20:40.940 --> 00:20:45.180
<b>Kishuu Province</b>

00:20:43.270 --> 00:20:46.050
It's nice weather today!

00:20:46.760 --> 00:20:48.510
Time for lunch!

00:20:51.570 --> 00:20:52.660
You're really good.

00:22:59.920 --> 00:23:01.660
Jinbei, you must train your eyes!

00:22:59.920 --> 00:23:03.000
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:01.660 --> 00:23:03.180
Follow that movement with your eyes!

00:23:03.180 --> 00:23:03.830
Yes!

00:23:03.830 --> 00:23:06.830
Watching Oharu-dono's breasts 
bounce is great training.

00:23:06.830 --> 00:23:08.260
You two are both perverts!

00:23:09.420 --> 00:23:11.010
Next time, on <i>Mushibugyo</i>:

00:23:11.100 --> 00:23:12.280
To Kishuu.

00:23:11.100 --> 00:23:14.000
<b>To Kishuu! 
The Ten Crucifix Insects of Sanada Appear!</b>

00:23:12.280 --> 00:23:14.000
The Ten Crucifix Insects of Sanada Appear.
